# Extended Error Help: {{ .errorCode }}

## What happened?
The app-id pattern below did not match any applications:

```text
{{ .pattern }}
```

## Why Hydra stops here
Hydra resolved the current context successfully, but it did not find any app IDs for the requested pattern.
This often means the context is valid already, but no root app chart exists yet.

## Resolution
{{- if eq .pattern "**" }}
1. If you expected at least one app, create a root app directory and add a valid `Chart.yaml`.
2. Otherwise, verify that app discovery is configured where you expect it.
{{- else }}
1. Check whether the requested app-id pattern is correct.
2. Run `hydra local apps **` to inspect which app IDs Hydra currently sees.
{{- end }}
